; Sprite: hatted figure, frame 0
;
; One 16x16 sprite of 32 bytes: 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel), drawn with
; #R$9456. Sprite 0 of the four figures with a pointed hat and a long dress (frame 4 of sprite page $9C; frames 0-1 of
; that page are the text leftovers at #R$9C00). #R$9534 draws them in the Master Bedroom (room $23) at $686E: $9C80 and
; $9CA0 alternate with bit 1 of #R$85CB while Willy stands on the floor (Y $D0), $9CC0 is used while his Y is $C0-$CF
; and $9CE0 when it is higher; drawing over Willy kills him. Entity definitions $46-$49 use all four in The Nightmare
; Room (room $1D).
@label=SpriteFigure0
b$9C80 DEFB $03,$00
